   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Eff: Public bldngs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till energieffektivisering i offentliga byggnader    och utf&#xf6;rs i samarbete med V&#xe4;rldbanken och Moldova Energy Project     Implementation Unit (MEPIU). Tre delkomponenter finns (i) TA f&#xf6;r      kvalitetss&#xe4;rkning av bankens Energy II projekt f&#xf6;r v&#xe4;rme, ii)         f&#xf6;rarbeten f&#xf6;r investeringar i Centre for Mother and Child sjukhuset, samt f&#xf6;r iii) Tironova sjukhuset.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase energy efficiency in social important public buildings.   Aligned to the WB programme and implemented by the Moldova Energy     Project Implementation Unit (MEPIU). 3 subprojects: i) TA to the      Energy II Extension of the Heating Component, a continuation ii) TA   to a feasibility study for the Mother and Child Hospital and iii)     Tirnova Hospital rehabilitation.</narrative>
  </description>
